	Section:
		Page numbering: none
		Inherit page overlays: false
		Text: Document and sections
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Page numbering
		Paragraph: Each section says how its pages are numbered. `none` leaves them without a number and outside the count, like a cover. `continue`, the default, follows the count. `restart` starts again at 1, or at `First number`. `{{pages}}` is the last number of the current count.
			Style: intro
		Text: Page numbering: none  (this page: no number and no footer)
			Style: card
	Section:
		Text: Page numbering: continue  (the default)
			Style: card
		Paragraph: This section follows the count from the start: its pages are 1 and 2.
		Text: The second page of the same section.
			Style: card
			Break:
				Before: page
	Section:
		Page numbering: restart
		First number: 10
		Text: Page numbering: restart, First number: 10
			Style: card
		Paragraph: This appendix starts a new count at 10, and the footer says 10 of 10.
